They prepare the table, they set the watch, they eat, they drink: rise up, you

          {+}
         princes, anoint the shield.

O you my threshing, and the grain of my floor! That which I have heard from Yahweh of hosts, the God of Israel, I have declared to you

          {+}
        .

The watchman said, The morning comes, and also the night: if you

          {+}
         will inquire, inquire

          {+}
        : turn

          {+}
        , come

          {+}
        .

The burden on Arabia. In the forest in Arabia you

          {+}
         will lodge, O you

          {+}
         caravans of Dedanites.
